@NODE PRODUkT
@TITLE "Product Informations"

  This is a AmiExpress Door for Replacement the Sysop Commands
  for more Sercurity and better Design

  You must Enter a Master Password in the .info File

   Tooltype:

   PASSWORD=<your Password>
    |
    `---> No Comments needed ,Note : Case Sensitive

   CALLERSLOG
    |
    `----> Writes a Comment when the Co/Sysop enters
           a wrong Master Password to the Callerslog




								@{"Main Menu" LINK MAIN}
@ENDNODE

@NODE INSTALL
@TITLE "Atom-Control 1.2 - Installation"

 * INSTALLATION *

 - Copy all file to BBS:Doors/<or where you like it>


 AE 3.xx Installation
 --------------------

  - Copy Open.info to BBS:Commands/BBScmd/

    Or add to <Command>.info:

      ACCESS=   <Access Level>
      LOCATION= <Door Location>
      MULTINODE=<Multi Node ?>
      PRIORITY= <Priority dont change it>
      TYPE=XIM


								@{"Main Menu" LINK MAIN}
@ENDNODE

@NODE INSTALLATION
@TITLE "Atom-Control - Installation"

 * INSTALLATION *

 - Kopieren Sie alle Files in folgenden Pfad 

   "BBS:DOORS/"

   AE 3.xx Installation
   ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯
 - Kopieren Sie das "<Command>.info zu "BBS:COMMANDS/BBSCMD/"

   Oder fügen Sie folgende Befehle in "<command>.info" ein

      ACCESS=   <Access Level>
      LOCATION= <Door Location>
      MULTINODE=<Multi Node ?>
      PRIORITY= <Priority dont change it>
      TYPE=XIM

								@{"Main Menu" LINK MAIN}
@ENDNODE

