@NODE CHANGES
@TITLE "Changes in Atom-Control V1.3"

   V1.0    Some bugs and to slow

   V1.1    New Password Routine
           Works now on AmiExpress 2.x with Password Protection
           Source Code modiefied for Faster Managment
           Added a new Callerslog Function
   V1.2    Test PW Routine Removed 
           have shows the Master PW before the Co/Sysop enters the PW
           Sorry for the nasty bug ..

   V1.3    absolute REWRITEN new Password Routine ,faster Screen Output
           better Error Handling


